-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
<YOUR_CUSTOMER_CA_CERTIFICATE>

This is the CloudHSM cluster CA certificate used to verify the HSM's identity.

To obtain this file:
  1. Go to AWS Console → CloudHSM → Clusters
  2. Select your cluster → Certificates tab
  3. Download the Cluster Certificate (customerCA.crt)

File location on Linux server after setup:
  /opt/cloudhsm/etc/customerCA.crt
-----END CERTIFICATE-----